# Helpers Directory

Reserved for custom Maestro helper JavaScript/flow utilities.

Potential future contents:
- `scrollUntilVisible.js` — scroll until an element is visible
- `waitForNetwork.js` — wait for network requests to complete
- Custom Maestro JavaScript extensions for complex interactions

These helpers are NOT Maestro flow files — they are reusable utilities
called from within flows (e.g., via `runScript`).
